      },
      {
        "source_hash": "c5c98a362f5f91931e96c128ce00adb875f4a084cd6cc1edd0738b7fb00cef54",
        "collection_id": "",
        "elem_order": 3,
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "extractor": "native_text",
        "confidence": 0.8999999761581421,
        "page": 0,
        "bbox": {
          "x": 0.13093988597393036,
          "y": 0.2831932008266449,
          "width": 0.7542238235473633,
          "height": 0.15751034021377563
        },
        "text": "1. As you are aware, Authorised Officers from the ACT Regulatory Authority (the Authority), also known as Children’s Education and Care Assurance, recently assessed a Notification of Incident (NOT-40822824) relating to Throsby Out of School Hours Care SE-40022307 (the Service) operated by Community Services #1 Incorporated PR-00005865 (the Provider).  2. The notified incident advised that, on 13 February 2023, a six-year-old child was booked into the Service but was missed from the role when educators went to collect the kindergarten children, subsequently leaving the child with the schoolteacher.",
        "alt_text": null,
        "header_rows": null,
        "sheet": null,
        "row": null,
        "col": null,
        "value": null,
        "value_type": null,
        "formula": null,
        "number_format": null,
        "merge_range": null,
        "meta": [
          [
            "has_redaction",
            "true"
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_hash": "c5c98a362f5f91931e96c128ce00adb875f4a084cd6cc1edd0738b7fb00cef54",
        "collection_id": "",
        "elem_order": 4,
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "extractor": "native_text",
        "confidence": 0.8999999761581421,
        "page": 0,
        "bbox": {
          "x": 0.13093988597393036,
          "y": 0.4459764063358307,
          "width": 0.7542229294776917,
          "height": 0.08652797341346741
        },
        "text": "3. The Authority is satisfied that the Provider has not complied with provisions of the Education and Care Services National Law Act (ACT) (the Law) in this instance. Web addresses for the Law and the Regulations are provided for your convenience at the end of this decision.",
        "alt_text": null,
        "header_rows": null,
        "sheet": null,
        "row": null,
        "col": null,
        "value": null,
        "value_type": null,
        "formula": null,
        "number_format": null,
        "merge_range": null,
        "meta": [
          [
            "has_redaction",
            "true"
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_hash": "c5c98a362f5f91931e96c128ce00adb875f4a084cd6cc1edd0738b7fb00cef54",
        "collection_id": "",
        "elem_order": 5,
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "extractor": "native_text",
        "confidence": 0.8999999761581421,
        "page": 0,
        "bbox": {
          "x": 0.13093988597393036,
          "y": 0.5376347899436951,
          "width": 0.754228949546814,
          "height": 0.21494224667549133
        },
        "text": "Facts  4. On 14 February 2023, the Authority received a Notification of Incident (NOT-40822824) from the Provider advising that, on 13 February 2023, a child, known to be  booked into the but missed from the roll and left with the teacher.   5. An educator noticed that  was absent from the Service and went to a teacher to locate him. He was not located in the school, family was called and on the way to the school, the mother located the child outside of the school premises as he had walked down the road towards his old childcare. Refer Attachment A.  6. Evidentiary documents provided with the notification included:",
        "alt_text": null,
        "header_rows": null,
        "sheet": null,
        "row": null,
        "col": null,
        "value": null,
        "value_type": null,
        "formula": null,
        "number_format": null,
        "merge_range": null,
