          "width": 0.5312979221343994,
          "height": 0.04503349959850311
        },
        "text": "Law  8. Provisions of the Law relevant to the notification assessment are:",
        "alt_text": null,
        "header_rows": null,
        "sheet": null,
        "row": null,
        "col": null,
        "value": null,
        "value_type": null,
        "formula": null,
        "number_format": null,
        "merge_range": null,
        "meta": []
      },
      {
        "source_hash": "c5c98a362f5f91931e96c128ce00adb875f4a084cd6cc1edd0738b7fb00cef54",
        "collection_id": "",
        "elem_order": 11,
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "extractor": "native_text",
        "confidence": 0.8999999761581421,
        "page": 1,
        "bbox": {
          "x": 0.178734689950943,
          "y": 0.1555033028125763,
          "width": 0.678220808506012,
          "height": 0.09762001037597656
        },
        "text": "Section 167(1) of the Law - Offence relating to protection of children from harm and hazards The approved provider of an education and care service must ensure that every reasonable precaution is taken to protect children being educated and care for by the service from harm and from any hazard likely to cause injury.",
        "alt_text": null,
        "header_rows": null,
        "sheet": null,
        "row": null,
        "col": null,
        "value": null,
        "value_type": null,
        "formula": null,
        "number_format": null,
        "merge_range": null,
        "meta": []
      },
      {
        "source_hash": "c5c98a362f5f91931e96c128ce00adb875f4a084cd6cc1edd0738b7fb00cef54",
        "collection_id": "",
        "elem_order": 12,
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "extractor": "native_text",
        "confidence": 0.8999999761581421,
        "page": 1,
        "bbox": {
          "x": 0.1658329963684082,
          "y": 0.2561160922050476,
          "width": 0.4276077449321747,
          "height": 0.08297703415155411
        },
        "text": "Penalty: $10 000, in the case of an individual        $50 000, in any other case.    Reasons",
        "alt_text": null,
        "header_rows": null,
        "sheet": null,
        "row": null,
        "col": null,
        "value": null,
        "value_type": null,
        "formula": null,
        "number_format": null,
        "merge_range": null,
        "meta": []
      },
      {
        "source_hash": "c5c98a362f5f91931e96c128ce00adb875f4a084cd6cc1edd0738b7fb00cef54",
        "collection_id": "",
        "elem_order": 13,
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "extractor": "native_text",
        "confidence": 0.8999999761581421,
        "page": 1,
        "bbox": {
          "x": 0.13093988597393036,
          "y": 0.34436607360839844,
          "width": 0.7540618181228638,
          "height": 0.14151343703269958
        },
        "text": "9. Upon considering all evidence for assessment, inclusive of Provider supplied information, the Authority is satisfied, on the balance of probabilities, that there is sufficient evidence to substantiate an offence under section s167(1) of the Law in this instance.   10. The very nature of the notification, admission of incident contributed to by errors in accountability of the roll, and actions taken by the Provider to address educator failings on the day support the non-compliances as identified.",
        "alt_text": null,
        "header_rows": null,
        "sheet": null,
        "row": null,
        "col": null,
        "value": null,
        "value_type": null,
        "formula": null,
        "number_format": null,
        "merge_range": null,
        "meta": []
      },
      {
        "source_hash": "c5c98a362f5f91931e96c128ce00adb875f4a084cd6cc1edd0738b7fb00cef54",
        "collection_id": "",
        "elem_order": 14,
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "extractor": "native_text",
        "confidence": 0.8999999761581421,
        "page": 1,
        "bbox": {
          "x": 0.13093988597393036,
          "y": 0.491009920835495,
          "width": 0.7541785836219788,
          "height": 0.08410527557134628
        },
        "text": "11. Considering the evidence, the objectives and guiding principles of the Law, the compliance history of the Service, and the steps taken by the Provider to mitigate risk of a similar incident, the Authority has decided to issue this administrative action rather than statutory compliance actions.",
        "alt_text": null,
        "header_rows": null,
        "sheet": null,
        "row": null,
        "col": null,
        "value": null,
        "value_type": null,
        "formula": null,
        "number_format": null,
        "merge_range": null,
        "meta": []
      },
      {
        "source_hash": "c5c98a362f5f91931e96c128ce00adb875f4a084cd6cc1edd0738b7fb00cef54",
        "collection_id": "",
        "elem_order": 15,
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "extractor": "native_text",
        "confidence": 0.8999999761581421,
        "page": 1,
        "bbox": {
          "x": 0.13093988597393036,
          "y": 0.5803881287574768,
          "width": 0.7542058825492859,
          "height": 0.10474559664726257
        },
        "text": "12. This Decision is intended to bring to your attention the need to ensure that the Provider meets its obligations under the Law, in particular the obligation that children are being appropriately accounted for at all stages of transition between the school and service, to ensure every reasonable precaution is taken to protect children from harm and any hazard likely to cause injury.",
        "alt_text": null,
        "header_rows": null,
        "sheet": null,
        "row": null,
        "col": null,
        "value": null,
        "value_type": null,
        "formula": null,
        "number_format": null,
        "merge_range": null,
        "meta": []
      },
      {
        "source_hash": "c5c98a362f5f91931e96c128ce00adb875f4a084cd6cc1edd0738b7fb00cef54",
        "collection_id": "",
        "elem_order": 16,
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "extractor": "native_text",
        "confidence": 0.8999999761581421,
        "page": 1,
        "bbox": {
          "x": 0.13093988597393036,
          "y": 0.6904066205024719,
          "width": 0.753716766834259,
          "height": 0.06573319435119629
        },
        "text": "13. This Decision will be recorded on the Service’s file and may be considered in any future applications for approvals, amendments or waivers. It may also be considered in determining the action to be taken, should further breaches of the Law or associated Regulations be found.",
        "alt_text": null,
        "header_rows": null,
